# Conformance probe pack for an inner `rest` inside an `if` of an outer
# `rest` item (spec 0.21 rulings 35 and 39), most significant bit first.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   items       items to the end of the message: a presence bit p and 7
#               unused bits; when p.1 is 1, subs to the end of the message
#               (val in 8 bits each). Only the last item may have subs.
format     conformance-extents-outerif
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.items rest
  presence p 1
  pad 7
  if p.1
    group  probe.subs rest
      field  probe.val  8  uint
    end
  end
end
